en-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp251p370473slbp0fffj413","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1qyaere","name":"IT之家（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"网络安全机构Socket发现针对npm生态的大规模供应链攻击“Mini Shai-Hulud”。攻击者组合利用GitHub Actions的三种漏洞，绕过了双重身份验证等保护机制，向TanStack、Mistral AI、UiPath等知名项目的软件包中植入恶意版本。被篡改的包在安装时会自动执行恶意代码，窃取AWS、GCP、Kubernetes、GitHub令牌及SSH私钥等敏感凭证。此次攻击波及超过160个包名、近373个恶意版本，目前所有恶意版本已被清理。","reportEdition":"2026-05-13","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp2yyzm101s0sl1qos08v1wc","title":"山姆·奥特曼因涉嫌利用OpenAI谋私利遭正式调查","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-05-13T00:00:00.073Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp2yyzm101s0sl1qos08v1wc","https://x.com/cb_doge/status/2054265408933462034"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp2yyzm101s0sl1qos08v1wc","title":"山姆·奥特曼因涉嫌利用OpenAI谋私利遭正式调查","originalTitle":"","summary":"美国佛罗里达、蒙大拿等六州司法部长联合致信美国证券交易委员会，要求调查OpenAI CEO山姆·奥特曼涉嫌利用公司谋取个人利益的行为。信中指出奥特曼在OpenAI无直接股权，个人财务利益与公司业绩关联有限，存在严重的自我交易和利益冲突风险。同时，美国众议院监督委员会主席也要求其提交相关投资文件。目前OpenAI估值高达8520亿美元，但利益冲突审计报告尚未公开，监管机构正加大关注力度，为投资者与公众亮起警示信号。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp2yyzm101s0sl1qos08v1wc","originalUrl":"https://x.com/cb_doge/status/2054265408933462034","publishedAt":"2026-05-13T00:00:00.073Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-cpgbcv","originalSourceName":"X：cb_doge (@cb_doge)","family":"outlet-5zs72o","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp2yyzm101s0sl1qos08v1wc","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-cpgbcv","name":"X：cb_doge (@cb_doge)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"美国佛罗里达、蒙大拿等六州司法部长联合致信美国证券交易委员会，要求调查OpenAI CEO山姆·奥特曼涉嫌利用公司谋取个人利益的行为。信中指出奥特曼在OpenAI无直接股权，个人财务利益与公司业绩关联有限，存在严重的自我交易和利益冲突风险。同时，美国众议院监督委员会主席也要求其提交相关投资文件。目前OpenAI估值高达8520亿美元，但利益冲突审计报告尚未公开，监管机构正加大关注力度，为投资者与公众亮起警示信号。","reportEdition":"2026-05-13","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp221o5403hcslbpdg55r3gw","title":"答案之外：信息呈现方式正成为AI智能层的一部分","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-05-13T00:00:00.073Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp221o5403hcslbpdg55r3gw","https://x.com/SiliconFlowAI/status/2054035848866504953"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp221o5403hcslbpdg55r3gw","title":"答案之外：信息呈现方式正成为AI智能层的一部分","originalTitle":"","summary":"信息的结构与呈现方式本身正成为AI智能层的关键。当前，让大语言模型以HTML格式输出，能提供比默认Markdown更丰富的视觉布局与交互性，是值得尝试的技巧。长远来看，人类虽偏好用音频输入，但视觉（图像/动画/视频）才是更理想的AI输出形式，因为大脑约三分之一皮层专司视觉处理。AI输出形态将沿“原始文本→Markdown→HTML→交互式神经视频/模拟”的路径演进，最终可能由扩散神经网络直接生成交互视频。同时，输入方式也需融合音频、文本、视频及手势等多模态交互。在人机输入输出深度融合方面，仍有巨大发展空间。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp221o5403hcslbpdg55r3gw","originalUrl":"https://x.com/SiliconFlowAI/status/2054035848866504953","publishedAt":"2026-05-13T00:00:00.073Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1bkpcx","originalSourceName":"X：硅基流动 SiliconFlow (@SiliconFlowAI)","family":"outlet-e5au5q","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp221o5403hcslbpdg55r3gw","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1bkpcx","name":"X：硅基流动 SiliconFlow (@SiliconFlowAI)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T04:01:34.769Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"信息的结构与呈现方式本身正成为AI智能层的关键。当前，让大语言模型以HTML格式输出，能提供比默认Markdown更丰富的视觉布局与交互性，是值得尝试的技巧。长远来看，人类虽偏好用音频输入，但视觉（图像/动画/视频）才是更理想的AI输出形式，因为大脑约三分之一皮层专司视觉处理。AI输出形态将沿“原始文本→Markdown→HTML→交互式神经视频/模拟”的路径演进，最终可能由扩散神经网络直接生成交互视频。同时，输入方式也需融合音频、文本、视频及手势等多模态交互。在人机输入输出深度融合方面，仍有巨大发展空间。","reportEdition":"2026-05-13","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp2vtrmz0130sl1q56jd7gq4","title":"使用ADK构建可暂停、恢复且永不丢失上下文的长时运行AI智能体","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-05-13T00:00:00.073Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp2vtrmz0130sl1q56jd7gq4","https://developers.googleblog.com/build-long-running-ai-agents-that-pause-resume-and-never-lose-context-with-adk"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp2vtrmz0130sl1q56jd7gq4","title":"使用ADK构建可暂停、恢复且永不丢失上下文的长时运行AI智能体","originalTitle":"","summary":"本文探讨了如何从无状态聊天机器人升级为生产级AI智能体，以管理长达数天或数周的企业工作流程（如HR入职）。通过引入Agent Development Kit（ADK），其架构核心采用持久状态机和持久化会话存储，确保智能体在“空闲时间”或服务器重启时永不丢失上下文。系统利用事件驱动的Webhook和多智能体委托机制，实现在暂停期间“休眠”，并在唤醒后以高推理准确性恢复复杂任务，从而构建出具备韧性和可靠性的长时运行智能体系统。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp2vtrmz0130sl1q56jd7gq4","originalUrl":"https://developers.googleblog.com/build-long-running-ai-agents-that-pause-resume-and-never-lose-context-with-adk","publishedAt":"2026-05-13T00:00:00.073Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-b2g4tp","originalSourceName":"Google Developers Blog（RSS）","family":"google","